abstract: >-
  Final datasets, human audit and critical-appraisal records, and deterministic code
  that reproduce the quantitative results of a human-verified, large language
  model-assisted synthesis of antibiotic resistance gene and mobile genetic element
  removal and residual burden in wastewater treatment systems.
